### Get My Channel
GET {{host}}/api/v1/channel/me
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}

### Get Channel by ID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/channel/827cc206-4d82-4f68-a506-cab8e76b4ad5

### Update channel
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/channel
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ahmad",
  "description": "desc"
}

### Update Channel Avatar
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/channel/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar-default.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../assets/avatar-default.png

--boundary--

### Update Channel Banner
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/channel/banner
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="banner"; filename="banner-default.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../assets/banner-default.png

--boundary--
